ncz-screensavers (0.3.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Black Hole: kipthorne (symmetric amber, no shifts) and faithful (Doppler,
    redshift and beaming; blue-white approaching side, dim red-orange receding
    side) are now clearly distinct.
  * xshadertoy goldenapollian: legal on Mali (global initializer fixed).

 -- Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 13:00:00 +0000

ncz-screensavers (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add the ncz-screensaver launcher, ncz-screensaver-idled idle daemon with
    its systemd user unit, the GTK4 settings app and the desktop entry.
  * blackhole-color-mode setting is exported to blackhole_gles3 as
    NCZ_BLACKHOLE_COLORS by the launcher.
  * Disable the older swayidle-based ncz-idle-manager user service on install.

 -- Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000

ncz-screensavers (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Consolidated ship set of 84 hacks (Black Hole, 35 hyprsaver, 36
    xshadertoy, 12 classics) with install rules and chooser catalog.
  * Black Hole: restore stylized/kipthorne/faithful color modes selected with
    NCZ_BLACKHOLE_COLORS; replace the screen-space jet cone (large-dots
    searchlight artifact) with collimated beams.
  * Add the dev.ncz.screensaver GSettings schema with blackhole-color-mode.

 -- Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
